### AGG1 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(author.id, author.firstName, author.lastName, replyCount)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[replyCount DESC, author.id ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: author.id, author.firstName, author.lastName | count(comment) AS replyCount]
  :       GetProperty(author.lastName) [node:Person]
  :         GetProperty(author.firstName) [node:Person]
  :           GetProperty(author.id) [node:Person]
  :             RelUniqueFilter[_r0, _r2]
  :               Expand((comment)-[_r2:HAS_CREATOR]->(author:Person))
  :                 Expand((m)<-[_r1:REPLY_OF]-(comment:Comment))
  :                   Expand((p)<-[_r0:HAS_CREATOR]-(m:Message))
  :                     Filter((p.id = 15393162799448))
  :                       GetProperty(p.id) [node:Person]
  :                         EntityScan(p:Person)

### AGG1 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[replyCount DESC, author.id ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: author.id, author.firstName, author.lastName | count(comment) AS replyCount]
      Fetch[mysql] in=(author) out=(author, author.firstName, author.id, author.lastName)
        : GetProperty(author.lastName) [node:Person]
        :   GetProperty(author.firstName) [node:Person]
        :     GetProperty(author.id) [node:Person]
        :       Argument(author)
        StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(p) out=(p, author, comment)
          : RelUniqueFilter[_r0, _r2]
          :   Expand((comment)-[_r2:HAS_CREATOR]->(author:Person))
          :     Expand((m)<-[_r1:REPLY_OF]-(comment:Comment))
          :       Expand((p)<-[_r0:HAS_CREATOR]-(m:Message))
          :         Argument(p)
          StoreQuery[mysql] out=(p)
            : Filter((p.id = 15393162799448))
            :   GetProperty(p.id) [node:Person]
            :     EntityScan(p:Person)

